            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Light Reflection"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(primal, evocation)\n\nRequirements: The gold defender is not in darkness\n\nThe gold defender reshapes its skin into a reflective surface that magnifies ambient light into a precise beam that burns all creatures in a 30-foot cone, dealing 14d6 fire damage (31 Reflex save if the gold defender is in dim light, 33 Reflex save if it's in bright light). It can't use Light Reflection again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature takes no damage.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and catches fire, taking 1d6 persistent fire damage.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, but the persistent fire damage is 5d6."
            },
